@startuml
[*] --> InitialState
InitialState : No terms added
InitialState --> OneTermAdded : add term

OneTermAdded : One term added
OneTermAdded --> TwoTermsAdded : add term
OneTermAdded --> [*] : perform search

TwoTermsAdded : Two terms added
TwoTermsAdded --> ThreeTermsAdded : add term
TwoTermsAdded --> [*] : perform search

ThreeTermsAdded : Three terms added
ThreeTermsAdded --> [*] : perform search

ThreeTermsAdded --> [*]
@enduml
